 class="workbench-revision">记录 #66</span></div><div class="workbench-scroll workbench-artifact-content"><section class="research-panel research-focus" aria-label="当前焦点"><div class="mb-2 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">当前问题 · 当前焦点</div><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold">判读结果 P2</h3><div class="focus-lines"><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">观测 13（1 次），落在 H3 的预测区间 [10, 15.5]</p><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">预登记分支：支持 H3、否定 H5</p></div></section><div data-state="active" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R1b:-trigger-probe" id="radix-:R1b:-content-probe" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 m-0 space-y-4 data-[state=inactive]:hidden" style="animation-duration:0s"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[12px]"><label for=":R0:" class="text-muted-foreground">实验</label><select id=":R0:" class="workbench-select"><option value="P1">P1（3 次）</option><option value="P2" selected="">P2（1 次）</option></select><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,border-color,color] duration-150 ease-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/40 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.97] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none hover:bg-accent/70 hover:text-accent-foreground h-8 rounded-sm px-3 ml-auto text-[11px]" type="button">查看版本</button></div><section class="min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-background" aria-label="P2 实验产物"><header class="border-b border-border px-5 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-mono">P2 · 实验对照</span><span class="">已记录测量</span></div><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold leading-relaxed">brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</h3><p class="mt-2 break-words text-xs leading-6 text-muted-foreground">brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA) · 重复次数 1</p><p class="break-words text-xs leading-6 text-muted-foreground">阻断剂：无</p></header><div class="px-5 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h4 class="text-sm font-medium">预测与实测</h4><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">spike_count · 同一数轴比较</p></div><div class="text-right"><span class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">实测值</span><p class="font-mono text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums">13</p></div></div><div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto"><svg class="block h-auto w-full min-w-[440px] text-foreground" viewBox="0 0 610 238" role="img" aria-labelledby=":Rjbb:-title :Rjbb:-desc"><title id=":Rjbb:-title">P2 各假设预测区间与实测值</title><desc id=":Rjbb:-desc">横线表示预测区间，菱形表示实测值。精确数值见下方数值表。落入区间不等于假设成立。</desc><g><line x1="92" x2="92" y1="18" y2="202" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.1"></line><text x="92" y="222" text-anchor="start" fill="currentColor" font-size="11">10</text></g><g><line x1="321.99999999999994" x2="321.99999999999994" y1="18" y2="202" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.1"></line><text x="321.99999999999994" y="222" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" font-size="11">18</text></g><g><line x1="552" x2="552" y1="18" y2="202" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.1"></line><text x="552" y="222" text-anchor="end" fill="currentColor" font-size="11">26</text></g><g><text x="12" y="40" fill="currentColor" font-size="13" font-weight="500">H3</text><line x1="92" x2="250.12499999999997" y1="36" y2="36" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.2" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="92" x2="250.12499999999997" y1